    "text": "When you reach 4th level, and again at 6th, 8th, 12th, 16th and 19th level, you can increase one ability score of your choice by 3, or you can increase three ability scores of your choice by 1. You can't increase an ability score above your ability score limit using this feature. You can also ignore this increase to instead gain a Feat."
